WEBVTT

00:24.277 --> 00:32.063
Kelsey's office. Three o'clock. She said to

00:32.203 --> 00:33.644
come alone.

00:36.185 --> 00:40.008
The door's shut. The air is thick.

00:44.132 --> 00:46.534
uniform.

00:47.594 --> 00:51.877
My blood runs cold, my hands go numb. I can't feel

00:51.897 --> 00:57.921
my own chair. He's holding out a folded sheet.

00:57.961 --> 01:04.205
This isn't fair. He looks at me. His face is grim.

01:06.326 --> 01:09.669
He starts to read the line. He doesn't know the

01:09.729 --> 01:14.776
words he holds are a trigger to my mind. Fine.

01:27.422 --> 01:31.263
Are you Aubrey Jordan Fuller? Stop the press!

01:31.663 --> 01:38.745
That is not my name! Stop the press! She's won the

01:38.785 --> 01:46.967
game! He's here! She's won! The walls are gone!

01:47.047 --> 01:51.408
No! No! No! No! No!

01:57.749 --> 02:08.778
No! No! No! No! No! No!

02:08.978 --> 02:12.341
Can't breathe. Can't see. Rocking. Shaking!

02:12.361 --> 02:17.986
King! King! Shaking! The lights are bright! The

02:18.006 --> 02:22.790
world is breaking! King! King! King! King! He's

02:22.830 --> 02:33.057
just a man. A uniform. He's just her. He's her in

02:33.077 --> 02:33.318
here.

02:51.318 --> 02:55.260
Are you Aubrey Jordan Fuller? SYSTEM CRASHED!

02:55.661 --> 03:02.424
THAT IS NOT MY NAME! SYSTEM CRASHED! SHE'S WON

